↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">紫</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">むらさき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">紫色；紫罗兰色；紫草（Lithospermum erythrorhizon）；酱油</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"208891\">その<ruby>色<rp>(</rp><rt>いろ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はピンクというより<ruby>紫<rp>(</rp><rt>むらさき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">它的颜色比粉红色更紫。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">無理</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">むり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">不合理；不自然；无正当理由；不可能；强行的；勉强的；强制的；过度的；过量的；过度劳累；过分努力；不可能；没门；做梦吧；（数学）无理的（如无理数）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"191503\"><ruby>悪<rp>(</rp><rt>わる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いけど、どうしたって<ruby>無理<rp>(</rp><rt>むり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だわ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">对不起,但我不能说什么。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">無料</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">むりょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">免费；无偿</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"223295\">こちらのパンフレットは<ruby>無料<rp>(</rp><rt>むりょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这个面板是免费的。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">群れ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">む